        {
          "text": "森林里着火了，",
          "image": "images/sen-lin-zhao-huo-le/01.jpg"
        },
        {
          "text": "猩猩搬起大石头控制了火势，",
          "image": "images/sen-lin-zhao-huo-le/02.jpg"
        },
        {
          "text": "大象用鼻子喷水，",
          "image": "images/sen-lin-zhao-huo-le/03.jpg"
        },
        {
          "text": "其他动物拿起泥土盖在火上，大家一起来灭火。",
          "image": "images/sen-lin-zhao-huo-le/04.jpg"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
